title: APC NetBotz: Cameras
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment
license: GPLv2
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors cameras connected to APC NetBotz appliances via SNMP
 (NetBotz50-MIB, cameraTable). The summary shows label, model and IP
 address of the camera.

 The service is {OK} if the camera is connected, {CRIT} if it is
 disconnected and {UNKNOWN} if the status is unknown. An error status of
 the camera adds {WARN} (warning) or {CRIT} (error, critical, failure).

item:
 The camera id as reported by the device.

discovery:
 One service is created for each camera.
